而且他和他们相处得非常好。

913
00:41:37.080 --> 00:41:38.960
They all play video games on their computers.
他们都在电脑上玩电子游戏。

914
00:41:38.960 --> 00:41:41.580
Although, it looks like Toby's really bad at it.
不过，看起来托比玩得很烂。

915
00:41:41.940 --> 00:41:42.100
Yeah.
是啊。

916
00:41:42.940 --> 00:41:45.040
They're just three single guys getting into trouble.
他们就是三个单身汉，到处惹麻烦。

917
00:41:45.480 --> 00:41:49.700
Well, there are two delicious candy bag alts for this Toby talking head.
关于托比的这个单人访谈，有两个非常精彩的备选方案。

918
00:41:49.860 --> 00:41:50.040
Ooh.
哦。

919
00:41:50.040 --> 00:41:51.520
They were in the shooting draft.
它们原本在拍摄剧本里。

920
00:41:51.520 --> 00:41:52.640
I want to share them with you.
我想和你们分享一下。

921
00:41:53.500 --> 00:41:54.280
Here's one.
这是第一个。

922
00:41:54.460 --> 00:41:55.560
Toby would have said,
托比本来说的是：

923
00:41:55.800 --> 00:41:59.640
There's two new guys back here with me going through Kelly's old complaints.
“我这儿来了两个新人，正在处理凯莉以前的投诉。”

924
00:42:00.040 --> 00:42:02.140
They're in their 20s, and we really get along.
“他们二十出头，我们真的很合得来。”

925
00:42:02.760 --> 00:42:04.320
Maybe that's been my problem.
“也许这就是我的问题所在。”

926
00:42:04.580 --> 00:42:06.600
I was born in the wrong generation.
“我生错了年代。”

927
00:42:07.360 --> 00:42:09.240
Well, that's one of my probleMs.
“好吧，那只是我的问题之一。”

928
00:42:10.180 --> 00:42:11.100
Wah, wah.
哇，哇。

929
00:42:11.460 --> 00:42:12.640
And here's the other one.
这是另一个。

930
00:42:13.340 --> 00:42:17.300
There are two new guys in the annex with me now, young guys in their 20s.
“现在附件办公室里有两个新人跟我一起，二十出头的年轻人。”

931
00:42:17.440 --> 00:42:22.380
I don't have a lot of friends, so it's nice to finally have two best friends.
“我没什么朋友，所以能有两个最好的朋友真是太好了。”

932
00:42:22.660 --> 00:42:23.700
Oh, Toby.
哦，托比。

933
00:42:24.580 --> 00:42:25.800
Stop breaking my heart, bud.
别再让我心碎了，伙计。

934
00:42:25.900 --> 00:42:26.500
Oh, come on.
噢，拜托。

935
00:42:27.300 --> 00:42:27.640
Ugh.
呃。

936
00:42:28.200 --> 00:42:31.760
Well, Stanley is going to say that the new guys are like the new Jim and Dwight.
斯坦利会说这两个新人就像新的吉姆和德怀特。

937
00:42:32.360 --> 00:42:33.280
Nellie agrees.
奈莉表示同意。

938
00:42:33.480 --> 00:42:34.180
Phyllis agrees.
菲利斯也表示同意。

939
00:42:34.560 --> 00:42:36.500
Jim and Dwight don't quite see it.
吉姆和德怀特并不这么认为。

940
00:42:37.600 --> 00:42:40.300
Meredith invites new Jim to sit on her face.
梅雷迪斯邀请新吉姆坐在她的脸上。

941
00:42:40.540 --> 00:42:44.440
He says, no, thank you, and also says his name is Pete.
他说不用了谢谢，还说他叫皮特。

942
00:42:45.060 --> 00:42:49.020
Jim is going to have a talking head where he says, Pete is not the new Jim.
吉姆会有一个单人访谈，他说皮特不是新吉姆。

943
00:42:49.240 --> 00:42:54.020
The only thing they have in common is that they both don't want to sit on Meredith's face.
他们唯一的共同点就是都不想坐在梅雷迪斯的脸上。

944
00:42:55.360 --> 00:42:58.880
And if that makes him the new Jim, then every human in the world is new Jim.
如果这就让他成了新吉姆，那全世界的人都是新吉姆了。

945
00:42:58.980 --> 00:43:00.280
I thought that was really funny.
我觉得这真的很有趣。

946
00:43:00.400 --> 00:43:00.880
I did too.
我也是。

947
00:43:01.260 --> 00:43:04.040
Greg said that from a storytelling standpoint,
格雷格说，从叙事的角度来看，

948
00:43:04.040 --> 00:43:08.280
the theme of the year was kind of a realization from both Dwight and Jim
这一年的主题是德怀特和吉姆都意识到，

949
00:43:08.280 --> 00:43:11.120
that they had been at Dunder Mifflin for a very long time.
他们在邓德·米福林待的时间实在太长了。

950
00:43:11.480 --> 00:43:16.640
By having these new guys come in who everybody was calling the new Dwight and the new Jim
通过引入这些被大家称为新德怀特和新吉姆的新人

951
00:43:16.640 --> 00:43:20.860
was a way to have Dwight and Jim think about just how long they've been in the same job
是为了让德怀特和吉姆思考他们在这份工作上待了多久

952
00:43:20.860 --> 00:43:25.440
and maybe to prod them into getting their lives moving into the next stage.
也许是为了促使他们推动自己的人生进入下一个阶段。

953
00:43:25.440 --> 00:43:30.220
Well, now it's time for a get-to-know-your-cast-and-crew moment from our call sheet.
好了，现在是我们的演职员表时间，来了解一下我们的剧组成员。

954
00:43:30.400 --> 00:43:30.740
Yay!
耶！

955
00:43:31.520 --> 00:43:35.620
This one is about Anna Coates, who was our key assistant location manager.
这一位是安娜·科茨，她曾担任我们的关键外景助理经理。

956
00:43:36.060 --> 00:43:38.040
Three things you didn't know about Anna Coates.
关于安娜·科茨，你不知道的三件事。

957
00:43:38.300 --> 00:43:40.780
Anna's favorite book is The Poisonwood Bible.
安娜最喜欢的书是《毒木圣经》。

958
00:43:40.840 --> 00:43:42.960
It's about four sisters from Africa.
讲的是四个来自非洲的姐妹的故事。

959
00:43:43.440 --> 00:43:47.880
She enjoyed rolling down hills as a child and now looks forward to long runs.
她小时候喜欢在山坡上打滚，现在则期待着长跑。

960
00:43:48.180 --> 00:43:53.980
If time traveling were an option, she would go to the 1960s, then the 40s, then shopping.
如果有时光旅行的机会，她会先去60年代，再去40年代，然后去购物。

961
00:43:53.980 --> 00:43:55.800
Oh, there you go.
哦，原来如此。

962
00:43:56.520 --> 00:44:00.300
You just got to know our key assistant location manager.
你刚刚认识了我们的关键外景助理经理。

963
00:44:00.620 --> 00:44:04.800
I am going to tell you right now that I'm going to need this to become a regular thing.
我现在就告诉你们，我需要把这个变成常规环节。

964
00:44:05.240 --> 00:44:07.080
I should have been doing it all along.
我早该这么做了。

965
00:44:07.760 --> 00:44:10.940
Nothing like picking something up in the last stretch, Ange.
在最后关头才开始做某事，安吉，真是没谁了。

966
00:44:12.780 --> 00:44:14.000
Guess what, everyone?
大家猜怎么着？

967
00:44:14.440 --> 00:44:16.760
Andy finally walks in the door.
安迪终于走进门了。

968
00:44:17.400 --> 00:44:21.520
Apparently, when you come back to work for the first time, you're allowed to be late.
显然，当你第一次重返工作岗位时，你是可以迟到的。

969
00:44:22.020 --> 00:44:23.300
He missed everyone.
他想念大家了。

970
00:44:23.980 --> 00:44:26.460
And he is immediately a jerk.
而且他立刻就变成了一个混蛋。

971
00:44:27.220 --> 00:44:27.780
Immediately?
立刻？

972
00:44:28.320 --> 00:44:28.660
Immediately.
立刻。

973
00:44:29.200 --> 00:44:31.580
He wants to know why Nellie's still working there.
他想知道为什么奈莉还在那儿工作。

974
00:44:31.740 --> 00:44:33.500
He said he had a dream she died.
他说他梦见她死了。

975
00:44:33.500 --> 00:44:36.420
And then says, meet me in my office later.
然后说，待会儿到我办公室来见我。

976
00:44:36.880 --> 00:44:39.300
Well, I'm going to call a bullsh** card here.
好吧，我要在这里质疑他在胡扯。

977
00:44:39.440 --> 00:44:40.040
What is it?
怎么了？

978
00:44:40.160 --> 00:44:47.420
Because at the end of Free Family Portrait, Andy calls Nellie a sly bastard and hires her back as special projects manager.
因为在《免费家庭肖像》结尾，安迪称奈莉为狡猾的混蛋，并重新聘请她担任特别项目经理。

979
00:44:47.580 --> 00:44:48.760
This was my question earlier.
这就是我之前的问题。

980
00:44:48.760 --> 00:44:50.520
Yes, they even shake on it.
没错，他们甚至还握手达成了协议。

981
00:44:50.660 --> 00:44:50.900
Right.
对。

982
00:44:51.200 --> 00:44:52.980
So I'm like, what happened?
所以我很纳闷，到底发生了什么？

983
00:44:53.440 --> 00:44:56.560
How did Outward Bound make Andy a colossal a**hole?
《外展训练》是怎么让安迪变成一个彻头彻尾的混蛋的？

984
00:44:56.720 --> 00:44:58.340
I found this in the shooting draft.
我在拍摄剧本里发现了这个。

985
00:44:58.340 --> 00:45:02.260
It doesn't help much, but it might have tipped off why Nellie was nervous.
虽然没多大帮助，但可能暗示了奈莉为什么会紧张。

986
00:45:02.680 --> 00:45:02.920
Okay.
好吧。

987
00:45:03.800 --> 00:45:08.480
Andy calls Toby into his office and says, hey, why is Nellie still here?
安迪把托比叫进办公室说，嘿，为什么奈莉还在？

988
00:45:08.760 --> 00:45:09.840
Didn't you get my postcard?
你没收到我的明信片吗？

989
00:45:10.220 --> 00:45:13.200
Toby has a talking head where he's holding up a postcard.
托比有一个采访镜头，他手里拿着一张明信片。

990
00:45:13.420 --> 00:45:18.140
He shows the postcard to the camera and says, on the front is a pretty waterfall.
他把明信片展示给镜头看，说，正面是一道漂亮的瀑布。

991
00:45:18.140 --> 00:45:20.320
On the back, it says, fire Nellie.
背面写着，解雇奈莉。

992
00:45:20.520 --> 00:45:23.160
Then he smells it and says, I don't think this is ink.
然后他闻了闻说，我觉得这不是墨水。

993
00:45:24.100 --> 00:45:24.580
Oh.
哦。

994
00:45:24.820 --> 00:45:25.180
Oh.
哦。

995
00:45:25.880 --> 00:45:27.080
What did he write it in?
他用什么写的？

996
00:45:27.100 --> 00:45:27.820
We don't know.
我们不知道。

997
00:45:28.240 --> 00:45:34.160
But it does tell us that Toby might have known that Andy wanted Nellie gone.
但这确实告诉我们，托比可能知道安迪想让奈莉走人。

998
00:45:34.500 --> 00:45:34.880
Okay.
好吧。

999
00:45:35.140 --> 00:45:35.520
Okay.
好吧。

1000
00:45:35.780 --> 00:45:36.160
Okay.
好吧。

1001
00:45:36.600 --> 00:45:40.340
Now Andy's going to greet the new guys and he's going to give them nicknames.
现在安迪要去迎接新人，还要给他们起绰号。

1002
00:45:40.560 --> 00:45:40.860
Yeah.
没错。

1003
00:45:41.040 --> 00:45:43.300
He said because Outward Bound is all about nicknames.
他说因为外展训练营的精髓就是绰号。

1004
00:45:43.480 --> 00:45:44.740
His was Iceman.
他的绰号是冰人。

1005
00:45:44.740 --> 00:45:49.560
He decides P will be Plop because he dumps all the time and he was going to call Clark
他决定叫P“噗噗”，因为他老是拉肚子，他本来还打算叫克拉克

1006
00:45:49.560 --> 00:45:54.440
Fart because they both do these things constantly, even though he doesn't know them at all.
“屁屁”，因为他们俩总是干这种事，尽管他根本就不了解他们。

1007
00:45:54.680 --> 00:45:56.440
He doesn't know any of their BMs.
他根本不知道他们的排便习惯。

1008
00:45:56.560 --> 00:45:57.120
You know what?
你知道吗？

1009
00:45:57.220 --> 00:45:59.300
We got a fan question from Jenna F.
我们收到了一位来自加利福尼亚州洛杉矶的粉丝珍娜·F的提问。

1010
00:45:59.440 --> 00:46:00.700
in Los Angeles, California.
加利福尼亚州洛杉矶。

1011
00:46:00.700 --> 00:46:00.750
Uh-oh.
噢哦。

1012
00:46:00.750 --> 00:46:01.700
Jenna wrote in again?
珍娜又写信来了？

1013
00:46:01.960 --> 00:46:06.040
Who would like to know who hired the new guys if Andy was away?
她想知道如果安迪不在，是谁雇佣了这些新人。

1014
00:46:06.640 --> 00:46:07.040
Oh.
噢。

1015
00:46:07.440 --> 00:46:08.180
Good call.
问得好。

1016
00:46:08.420 --> 00:46:11.940
And was there a postcard to Toby saying hire two new guys?
有没有一张明信片寄给托比说雇两个新人？

1017
00:46:11.940 --> 00:46:12.580
Yeah.
有。

1018
00:46:12.840 --> 00:46:15.120
I want to make fun of him and call him Plop and Fart.
我想取笑他，叫他“噗噗”和“屁屁”。

1019
00:46:15.280 --> 00:46:15.780
Exactly.
没错。

1020
00:46:16.380 --> 00:46:18.420
Daryl says they've been calling Clark Dwight Jr.
达里尔说他们一直叫克拉克“小德怀特”。

1021
00:46:18.880 --> 00:46:20.760
Clark says, I prefer Fart.
克拉克说，我宁愿被叫“屁屁”。

1022
00:46:20.940 --> 00:46:21.360
I know.
我知道。

1023
00:46:21.640 --> 00:46:24.180
But Dwight is very excited about this idea.
但德怀特对这个主意非常兴奋。

1024
00:46:24.400 --> 00:46:26.780
He's like, in a way, he has a son.
他觉得在某种程度上，他有了一个儿子。

1025
00:46:26.980 --> 00:46:30.840
Maybe someday they'll hire someone who looks like a younger Clark and then he'll have a
也许有一天他们会雇一个长得像年轻版克拉克的人，那样他就有了

1026
00:46:30.840 --> 00:46:31.320
grandson.
一个孙子。

1027
00:46:31.840 --> 00:46:32.860
So ridiculous.
太荒谬了。

1028
00:46:33.500 --> 00:46:35.220
It's so incredibly ridiculous.
简直荒谬透顶。

1029
00:46:35.220 --> 00:46:41.560
Well, next up starts a storyline for Angela, but I think we should take a break and then
好了，接下来是安吉拉的一条故事线，但我觉得我们应该先休息一下，然后

1030
00:46:41.560 --> 00:46:44.100
we'll come back and discuss the rehoming of Comstock.
回来讨论康斯托克的领养问题。

1031
00:46:44.420 --> 00:46:44.780
Yes.
好的。

1032
00:46:44.940 --> 00:46:48.660
It also has a line that I get quoted a lot.
里面还有一句我经常被引用的台词。

1033
00:46:48.680 --> 00:46:49.360
I know it.
我知道是哪句。

1034
00:47:01.150 --> 00:47:04.010
Well, we're back and we're over in accounting.
好了，我们回来了，现在在会计部。

1035
00:47:04.210 --> 00:47:06.950
Angela's sharing that she has to put up one of her cats for adoption.
安吉拉说她不得不把她的一只猫送去领养。

1036
00:47:07.450 --> 00:47:09.890
Kevin wonders which one and starts listing them.
凯文想知道是哪一只，就开始列举起来。

1037
00:47:10.550 --> 00:47:12.470
This is how it read in the shooting draft.
拍摄剧本里是这样写的。

1038
00:47:12.470 --> 00:47:17.550
Kevin, the one who uses the doorbell or the one with the Mexican hat or the one with the
凯文，是那只会按门铃的，还是戴墨西哥帽的那只，或者是穿

1039
00:47:17.550 --> 00:47:19.790
rain galoshes or the one you let go around naked.
雨靴的那只，还是你让它光着身子的那只？

1040
00:47:20.430 --> 00:47:20.950
Yes.
是的。

1041
00:47:21.490 --> 00:47:25.670
Angela says, no, the one with the long hair and the denim pants.
安吉拉说，不是，是那只长毛、穿牛仔裤的。

1042
00:47:25.970 --> 00:47:26.490
Comstock.
康斯托克。

1043
00:47:26.970 --> 00:47:27.290
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1044
00:47:27.650 --> 00:47:32.930
She shows Kevin and Oscar photos of Comstock and this is what the shooting draft said.
她给凯文和奥斯卡看了康斯托克的照片，拍摄剧本里是这样写的。

1045
00:47:33.230 --> 00:47:38.370
There's a video of a long-haired cat in little jeans sitting on a motorcycle and sitting
视频里是一只长毛猫穿着小牛仔裤坐在摩托车上，还有坐在

1046
00:47:38.370 --> 00:47:43.610
on a pillow being hugged by the senator as the song Nobody Does It Better plays.
枕头上被参议员抱着，背景音乐放着《没有人比你更好》。

1047
00:47:44.310 --> 00:47:49.190
The videos of Comstock were some of the first scenes that we filmed on day two of filming
康斯托克的视频是我们拍摄这一集第二天，也就是7月31日，

1048
00:47:49.190 --> 00:47:52.370
this episode, which was July 31St.
最早拍摄的几个场景之一。

1049
00:47:52.490 --> 00:47:55.830
And there were some additional notes on the call sheet for this day.
那天通告单上还有一些额外的备注。

1050
00:47:56.270 --> 00:47:57.170
Here's one.
这是其中一条。

1051
00:47:57.510 --> 00:48:00.890
There will be a large working crane in the main parking lot.
主停车场将会有一台大型作业起重机。

1052
00:48:01.110 --> 00:48:04.750
Please see attached memo regarding where to park across the street.
关于街对面停车地点的安排，请参阅随附的备忘录。

1053
00:48:05.390 --> 00:48:10.290
Second announcement, a slackline rehearsal will take place for Dwight and Clark in the
第二条通知，德怀特和克拉克将在仓库的秋千区进行

1054
00:48:10.290 --> 00:48:11.790
swing set area of the warehouse.
扁带走绳排练。

1055
00:48:12.250 --> 00:48:13.870
More slackline rehearsal.
更多扁带走绳排练。

1056
00:48:14.230 --> 00:48:16.550
Second slackline rehearsal for those guys.
那是他们两人的第二次扁带走绳排练。

1057
00:48:16.970 --> 00:48:22.230
Kevin is now going to offer to take Comstock, but Angela quickly rejects this because of,
凯文现在主动提出要带走康斯托克，但安吉拉很快就拒绝了，因为，

1058
00:48:22.310 --> 00:48:23.550
um, hello, the turtle.
呃，拜托，那是只乌龟。

1059
00:48:24.110 --> 00:48:24.590
Okay.
好吧。

1060
00:48:24.870 --> 00:48:28.030
Hey, Kevin is enormously proud of what he did for that turtle.
嘿，凯文对他为那只乌龟所做的事感到无比自豪。

1061
00:48:28.250 --> 00:48:30.350
She says, Oscar, will you take him?
她说，奥斯卡，你愿意带它吗？

1062
00:48:30.450 --> 00:48:32.290
And he says, no, I'm a dog person.
他说，不，我更喜欢狗。

1063
00:48:32.290 --> 00:48:38.250
And here, for those of you who know all of Angela Martin's famous lines, is one of my
现在，对于那些了解安吉拉·马丁所有名言的人，这里有我的一句

1064
00:48:38.250 --> 00:48:38.990
famous lines.
名言。

1065
