got her cat Comstock when she was dating Andy, and that maybe it was Andy who named the cat.
是在和安迪约会时得到猫康斯托克的，也许是安迪给猫取的名字。

1072
00:49:02.730 --> 00:49:08.670
Because I noticed that in season five, episode six, when Andy is getting annoyed with Dwight
因为我注意到在第五季第六集里，当安迪因为德怀特申请康奈尔大学

