00:49:28.550 --> 00:49:29.710
about Phillip's allergies.
菲利普的过敏问题。

1079
00:49:30.270 --> 00:49:30.470
Yep.
没错。

1080
00:49:30.970 --> 00:49:33.990
I like to think that everyone Angela ever dated got her a cat.
我愿意相信安吉拉约会过的每个人都送过她一只猫。

1081
00:49:35.670 --> 00:49:36.890
She has Comstock.
她有康斯托克。

1082
00:49:37.050 --> 00:49:37.830
She has garbage.
她有垃圾。

1083
00:49:38.310 --> 00:49:38.550
Yeah.
是啊。

1084
00:49:39.410 --> 00:49:41.190
We are now in Andy's office.
我们现在在安迪的办公室。

1085
00:49:41.430 --> 00:49:43.230
He's getting off the phone with David Wallace.
他刚和戴维·华莱士通完电话。

1086
00:49:43.450 --> 00:49:46.850
Toby enters, and Andy is going to ask him why Nellie is still there.
托比进来了，安迪打算问他为什么内莉还在那儿。

1087
00:49:46.850 --> 00:49:48.190
And Toby says, you know what?
托比说，你知道吗？

1088
00:49:48.270 --> 00:49:49.830
He can only fire her for cause.
他只能因正当理由解雇她。

1089
00:49:49.970 --> 00:49:54.470
So Andy has decided that he's going to try to make something up to get her fired.
所以安迪决定他要试着编造点什么来让她被解雇。

1090
00:49:54.730 --> 00:49:59.390
Yeah, but Toby says, well, now we can't fire her because you told me that it's going to
是啊，但托比说，好吧，现在我们不能解雇她了，因为你告诉我那是

1091
00:49:59.390 --> 00:50:00.130
be made up.
编造的。

1092
00:50:00.290 --> 00:50:01.230
And now I know.
现在我知道了。

1093
00:50:01.490 --> 00:50:01.810
Yeah.
是啊。

1094
00:50:02.110 --> 00:50:04.190
And Andy's like, well, forget I said that.
安迪说，好吧，忘掉我说过的话吧。

1095
00:50:04.490 --> 00:50:08.570
And Toby says, I can't forget because I went to the Weintraub Memory Academy.
托比说，我忘不掉，因为我去过温特劳布记忆学院。

1096
00:50:08.890 --> 00:50:09.230
Yes.
是的。

1097
00:50:09.430 --> 00:50:10.310
Not real, I looked it up.
那不是真的，我查过了。

1098
00:50:10.310 --> 00:50:11.470
Not real, I looked it up.
那不是真的，我查过了。

1099
00:50:13.270 --> 00:50:16.670
Toby says, I sat next to Beverly Brooke, who ate a Greek salad for lunch.
托比说，我坐在贝弗利·布鲁克旁边，她午餐吃的是希腊沙拉。

1100
00:50:16.850 --> 00:50:21.530
And Andy goes, ugh, I now understand why Michael hated you so much.
安迪说，呃，我现在明白为什么迈克尔那么讨厌你了。

1101
00:50:21.730 --> 00:50:24.630
Dwight is now going to approach Clark in the break room.
德怀特现在要到休息室去找克拉克了。

1102
00:50:24.790 --> 00:50:26.970
This line made me laugh so hard.
这句台词让我笑得不行。

1103
00:50:27.090 --> 00:50:27.970
Which one?
哪一句？

1104
00:50:28.570 --> 00:50:29.610
There's so many.
太多了。

1105
00:50:29.750 --> 00:50:37.990
But when Dwight invites him to a Slayer concert that's 10 months away, it's like, who does that?
但当德怀特邀请他去参加十个月后的金属乐队演唱会时，我就在想，谁会这么做啊？

1106
00:50:38.170 --> 00:50:40.070
It made me very curious, though.
不过这确实让我很好奇。

1107
00:50:40.270 --> 00:50:42.310
