Dwight's like, what sales meeting?
德怀特就像是说，什么销售会议？

1152
00:52:26.770 --> 00:52:27.430
What are you talking about?
你在说什么呢？

1153
00:52:27.750 --> 00:52:30.130
Yeah, I guess Clark ended the meeting with karate.
是啊，我猜克拉克是用空手道结束会议的。

1154
00:52:30.430 --> 00:52:32.250
Apparently, he's above a black belt.
显然，他的段位比黑带还高。

1155
00:52:32.730 --> 00:52:33.510
Oh, lady.
噢，女士。

1156
00:52:33.930 --> 00:52:35.290
The scene was longer.
那一幕其实更长。

1157
00:52:35.490 --> 00:52:36.030
It was.
确实。

1158
00:52:36.230 --> 00:52:38.950
And Dwight keeps coming back and reporting to Jim about it.
而且德怀特一直回来向吉姆汇报这件事。

1159
00:52:38.950 --> 00:52:42.710
And I need to play a clip because there's a Star Wars reference.
我得放一段剪辑，因为里面有个《星球大战》的梗。

1160
00:52:43.870 --> 00:52:44.070
PsSt.
嘘。

1161
00:52:45.250 --> 00:52:47.550
Clark just told me that he never studied karate.
克拉克刚告诉我他从来没学过空手道。

1162
00:52:47.730 --> 00:52:48.670
Why would he lie to me?
他为什么要骗我？

1163
00:52:49.050 --> 00:52:49.530
I don't know.
我不知道。

1164
00:52:49.590 --> 00:52:51.390
I thought you guys really had a good father-son thing going.
我还以为你们俩真的有那种很好的父子情谊呢。

1165
00:52:51.590 --> 00:52:52.730
Kind of like Luke and Darth Vader.
就像卢克和达斯·维达那样。

1166
00:52:53.530 --> 00:52:53.690
No.
不。

1167
00:52:54.530 --> 00:52:54.930
Idiot.
白痴。

1168
00:52:55.370 --> 00:52:56.870
Luke and Darth Vader are enemies.
卢克和达斯·维达是敌人。

1169
00:52:57.250 --> 00:52:57.570
What?
什么？

1170
00:52:57.950 --> 00:52:58.250
Yeah.
是啊。

1171
00:52:58.490 --> 00:53:00.570
Darth Vader tried to attach a hand on Luke's arm.
达斯·维达试图给卢克的手臂安上一只手。

1172
00:53:00.650 --> 00:53:01.810
No, he cut it off.
不，他是把那只手砍掉了。

1173
00:53:01.950 --> 00:53:03.110
What Star Wars are you watching?
你到底看的是哪部《星球大战》？

1174
00:53:03.110 --> 00:53:05.810
Luke is trying to destroy Darth Vader.
卢克是在试图消灭达斯·维达。

1175
00:53:07.210 --> 00:53:10.610
Well, Angela, as you know, I understood that entire scene.
好吧，安吉拉，如你所知，我完全看懂了那一幕。

1176
00:53:10.810 --> 00:53:12.390
