He said it took over a week just to do all the rigging.
为了这个特技，他们在停车场放了一个巨大的安全气囊。

1539
01:10:02.170 --> 01:10:05.630
And for the stunt, they had a giant airbag in the parking lot.
我记得那个气囊。

1540
01:10:05.750 --> 01:10:07.370
And I remember it.
我也记得。

1541
01:10:07.470 --> 01:10:08.590
I remember it, too.
通告单里也有写。

1542
01:10:08.810 --> 01:10:10.450
It's also in the call sheet.
