Steve also mentioned that it was really windy that day.
天哪。

1547
01:10:20.750 --> 01:10:21.290
Oh, Lord.
而且因为风的原因，在钢丝上骑车其实很难。

1548
01:10:21.290 --> 01:10:25.630
And it was actually hard to ride the bike on the wire because of the wind.
所以他说我们拍了三次才完成这个特技，但最终成功了。

1549
01:10:25.930 --> 01:10:30.650
And so he said we did three takes of the stunt, but it worked.
我记得当时站在停车场抬头看着那个特技演员。

1550
01:10:30.770 --> 01:10:34.470
I remember standing in the parking lot looking up at the stunt guy.
是的。

1551
01:10:34.590 --> 01:10:35.510
All of us there.
我们都在那儿。

1552
01:10:35.750 --> 01:10:39.150
I was convinced I was going to see a death that day.
我当时确信那天我会目睹一场死亡。

