01:10:39.270 --> 01:10:40.150
I'm going to be honest with you.
老实跟你说吧。

1554
01:10:40.250 --> 01:10:41.490
I was terrified.
我当时吓坏了。

1555
01:10:41.670 --> 01:10:44.710
It was the most stressful thing.
那是压力最大的一件事。

1556
01:10:44.710 --> 01:10:52.810
I don't know how anyone works on action movies where they do all of these crazy stunts.
我不知道别人是怎么拍动作片的，他们得做那么多疯狂的特技。

1557
01:10:52.950 --> 01:10:54.450
It was so terrifying.
那太可怕了。

1558
01:10:54.690 --> 01:10:55.650
So terrifying.
太可怕了。

1559
01:10:56.290 --> 01:11:00.770
Steve Burgess says the shot of rain hanging from the bike is actually rain.
史蒂夫·伯吉斯说，那个雨挂在自行车上的镜头其实真的是雨。

1560
01:11:01.270 --> 01:11:05.990
However, what they did was they built a scaffold under the bike.
不过，他们是在自行车下面搭了个脚手架。

1561
01:11:06.190 --> 01:11:10.570
